            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dani"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used tequila instead of rum. The first batch was a little too sweet for my tastes but everyone else loved it. The second batch I only used 2 1/2 cups of sugar and it turned out perfect.",
